      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.29,
      "end_seconds": 12.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "that's fine sit down tell me why you came"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.95,
      "end_seconds": 22.32,
      "duration_seconds": 8.37,
      "text": "I've been dealing with a back that has got shorter. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.01,
      "end_seconds": 28.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.14,
      "end_seconds": 33.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "it's alendronate 70 milligrams once a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.84,
      "end_seconds": 39.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "so, can you tell me when it it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.51,
      "end_seconds": 44.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Yesterday it it came on out of nowhere"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.5,
      "end_seconds": 48.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Okay, go on. How strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.19,
      "end_seconds": 55.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "Let me think I'd give it a four out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.42,
      "end_seconds": 66.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "And what about fever, weight loss, numbness or bladder problems?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.44,
      "end_seconds": 75.14,
      "duration_seconds": 6.7,
      "text": "Erm, I haven't had fever, weight loss, numbness or bladder problems, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.94,
      "end_seconds": 79.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "how about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.09,
      "end_seconds": 83.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "no, nothing with my heart"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.21,
      "end_seconds": 88.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.63,
      "end_seconds": 91.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Yes thin bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.76,
      "end_seconds": 93.46,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.24,
      "end_seconds": 111.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "what line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.95,
      "end_seconds": 116.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.6,
      "end_seconds": 120.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.31,
      "end_seconds": 124.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.54,
      "end_seconds": 126.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.12,
      "end_seconds": 132.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "no, uh, I've never been operated on"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.15,
      "end_seconds": 146.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.27,
      "end_seconds": 150.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Yes, walnuts. I get hives."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.73,
      "end_seconds": 164.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Okay I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.58,
      "end_seconds": 179.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "sit still for a moment.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.38,
      "end_seconds": 201.45,
      "duration_seconds": 12.07,
      "text": "okay: weight 77 kilos, SpO2 99 percent on room air, pulse 78, respiratory rate 14, temperature is 36.7 degrees, blood pressure 111 over 68, height 156 centimetres"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.05,
      "end_seconds": 204.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.46,
      "end_seconds": 212.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "that's fine, I'll explain it soon"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.21,
      "end_seconds": 220.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it it won't take long"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.05,
      "end_seconds": 224.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.18,
      "end_seconds": 241.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "There is a curve in the upper back and you are three centimetres shorter than before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.51,
      "end_seconds": 247.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "right, please sit back down"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.47,
      "end_seconds": 277.71,
      "duration_seconds": 14.24,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, this is probably osteoporosis with a fragility fracture. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.82,
      "end_seconds": 281.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.4,
      "end_seconds": 307.45,
      "duration_seconds": 24.05,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It It looks like osteoporosis with a fragility fracture, but I'd like to confirm. We should do blood tests for osteoporosis. Take the tablet with a full glass of water, and stay upright for thirty minutes. Come back in three months. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.42,
      "end_seconds": 312.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "great uh thank you for your help"
    }
  ]
